! kind streams

Bridges [[Streams|$:/plugins/sq/streams]] and [[kind|$:/plugins/rimir/kind]] so that individual Streams //nodes// can be turned into typed kind instances, marked as such, and edited — all without leaving the Streams outline.

!! What it does

* //Identify// — every Streams node that has a `kind.type` shows a small pill with its type key, right in the outline. A subtle accent marks the row.
* //Edit in place// — click the pill to expand kind's compact field bar for that node (click a field to edit; toggle inline/popup). The bar is rendered ''lazily'', only for the node you open.
* //Assign a type// — right-click any node → ''Kind type ▸'' opens a flyout submenu (styled like the Streams menu itself) listing the kind types; pick one to set, change (✓ marks the current) or remove its `kind.type`.

//Extend rows// — other plugins can add something to every row by tagging a tiddler `$:/tags/rimir/kind-streams/row-addon` (used by [[rimir/streams-ports|$:/plugins/rimir/streams-ports]] for port handles), without overriding the Streams row template themselves.

!! Performance

This plugin is built to stay cheap in large outlines:

* An //untyped// node costs one `has[kind.type]` test and renders nothing extra.
* A //typed, collapsed// node renders one pill (a single field read — no type lookup) plus a `<$reveal>` whose contents are not rendered until opened.
* The full, more expensive field bar renders only for the nodes you actually expand.
* The type submenu renders inside the context menu, and its type list only when you open the flyout — never per node.

!! Prerequisites

* [[kind|$:/plugins/rimir/kind]] (required) — provides the type system, the field bar (`stream-view`) and the type picker.
* [[Streams|$:/plugins/sq/streams]] (required for the in-outline features) — this plugin overrides one Streams template (`stream-row-body`) via a higher `plugin-priority`.

!! Quick start

# Install alongside kind and Streams.
# Open a Streams outline and right-click a node → ''Kind type ▸'' → pick a type.
# The node now shows a type pill. Click it to edit the type's fields inline.

Everything can be turned off with the toggle in the [[settings|$:/plugins/rimir/kind-streams/settings]] tab.
